<body lang="EN-US" link="blue" vlink="purple" style="tab-interval: .5in">
<div class="WordSection1" style="page: WordSection1;">
<table class="MsoNormalTable" border="1" cellpadding="0" width="720" style="width: 7.5in; mso-cellspacing: 1.5pt; background: white; border: solid #E5E5E5 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: solid #E5E5E5 .75pt; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 10.5pt 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;">
<tbody>
<tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes;">
<td style="border: none; padding: 9.0pt .75pt 3.75pt 35.25pt;">
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-style-unhide: no;mso-style-qformat: yes;mso-style-parent: &quot;&quot;;margin: 0in;margin-bottom: .0001pt;mso-pagination: widow-orphan;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast;"><span style="font-size: 24.0pt; font-family: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; color: #086db6;"> Verify your e-mail </span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt 30.0pt .75pt 27.75pt;">
<div class="MsoNormal" align="center" style="text-align: center;line-height: 15.0pt;mso-style-unhide: no;mso-style-qformat: yes;mso-style-parent: &quot;&quot;;margin: 0in;margin-bottom: .0001pt;mso-pagination: widow-orphan;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast;"><hr size="1" width="100%" noshade="noshade" style="color: #e5e5e5;" align="center"></div>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt .75pt .75pt 33.0pt;" id="emailMainDiv">
<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 15.0pt;mso-style-unhide: no;mso-style-qformat: yes;mso-style-parent: &quot;&quot;;margin: 0in;margin-bottom: .0001pt;mso-pagination: widow-orphan;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast;"><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"><span style="font-family: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; color: #666666;">Action Required </span></b></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt 45.0pt .75pt 33.0pt;">
<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 15.0pt;mso-style-unhide: no;mso-style-qformat: yes;mso-style-parent: &quot;&quot;;margin: 0in;margin-bottom: .0001pt;mso-pagination: widow-orphan;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast;"><span style="font-family: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; color: #666666;">This notice is to inform you that a profile has been created for you by an Intel Representative because of your interest in </span><span style="font-family: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; color: #0070c0;"> Channel MDF.</span></p>
<br>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 15.0pt;mso-style-unhide: no;mso-style-qformat: yes;mso-style-parent: &quot;&quot;;margin: 0in;margin-bottom: .0001pt;mso-pagination: widow-orphan;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast;"><span style="font-family: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; color: #666666;">Please retain this e-mail for future reference. </span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt 45.0pt .75pt 33.0pt;">
<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 15.0pt;mso-style-unhide: no;mso-style-qformat: yes;mso-style-parent: &quot;&quot;;margin: 0in;margin-bottom: .0001pt;mso-pagination: widow-orphan;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast;"><span style="font-family: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; color: #666666;"><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;">E-mail Address:</b> </span><span style="font-family: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; color: #0070c0;">{!Contact.Email}</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt .75pt .75pt 33.0pt;">
<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 15.0pt;mso-style-unhide: no;mso-style-qformat: yes;mso-style-parent: &quot;&quot;;margin: 0in;margin-bottom: .0001pt;mso-pagination: widow-orphan;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast;"><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"><span style="font-family: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; color: #666666;">What you need to do </span></b></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt 45.0pt .75pt 33.0pt;">
<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 15.0pt;mso-style-unhide: no;mso-style-qformat: yes;mso-style-parent: &quot;&quot;;margin: 0in;margin-bottom: .0001pt;mso-pagination: widow-orphan;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast;"><span style="font-family: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; color: #666666;">Please verify your e-mail address by clicking this <a href="https://partnercenter.intel.com/login?so=00Do0000000aRcf" style="mso-style-noshow: yes;mso-style-priority: 99;color: blue;text-decoration: underline;text-underline: single;">link</a></span><span style="font-family: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; color: #666666;">, or by copying the URL into your browser.<br> <!-- <a href="!%ActivationURL%!"><span style='text-decoration: none; text-underline: none'>
                                    !%ActivationURL%!</span></a> --> </span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt 45.0pt .75pt 33.0pt;"></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt 45.0pt .75pt 33.0pt;">
<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 15.0pt;mso-style-unhide: no;mso-style-qformat: yes;mso-style-parent: &quot;&quot;;margin: 0in;margin-bottom: .0001pt;mso-pagination: widow-orphan;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast;"><span style="font-family: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; color: #666666;">If you feel you have received this e-mail in error, please contact us <a href="http://www.intel.com/p/en_US/support" style="mso-style-noshow: yes;mso-style-priority: 99;color: blue;text-decoration: underline;text-underline: single;"> here</a>.</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt 45.0pt .75pt 33.0pt;">
<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 15.0pt;mso-style-unhide: no;mso-style-qformat: yes;mso-style-parent: &quot;&quot;;margin: 0in;margin-bottom: .0001pt;mso-pagination: widow-orphan;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast;"><span style="font-family: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; color: #666666;">Visit this <a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/secure/profile/myprofile.html" style="mso-style-noshow: yes;mso-style-priority: 99;color: blue;text-decoration: underline;text-underline: single;"> link</a> any time to manage your profile.</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt .75pt .75pt 33.0pt;">
<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 15.0pt;mso-style-unhide: no;mso-style-qformat: yes;mso-style-parent: &quot;&quot;;margin: 0in;margin-bottom: .0001pt;mso-pagination: widow-orphan;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast;"><span style="font-family: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; color: #62686e;">Please DO NOT reply to this e-mail message. This is an automated response.<br> To ensure that you continue receiving our e-mails, please add us to your address book. </span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt 30.0pt .75pt 33.0pt;">
<div class="MsoNormal" align="center" style="text-align: center;line-height: 15.0pt;mso-style-unhide: no;mso-style-qformat: yes;mso-style-parent: &quot;&quot;;margin: 0in;margin-bottom: .0001pt;mso-pagination: widow-orphan;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast;"><hr size="1" width="100%" noshade="noshade" style="color: #e5e5e5;" align="center"></div>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="border: none; padding: 9.0pt .75pt .75pt 33.0pt;">
<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 15.0pt;mso-style-unhide: no;mso-style-qformat: yes;mso-style-parent: &quot;&quot;;margin: 0in;margin-bottom: .0001pt;mso-pagination: widow-orphan;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast;"><span style="font-family: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; color: #666666;">Intel is committed to protecting your privacy. For more information,<br> please see the <a href="http://www.intel.com/privacy" style="mso-style-noshow: yes;mso-style-priority: 99;color: blue;text-decoration: underline;text-underline: single;"><span style="text-decoration: none; text-underline: none;">Intel Privacy Notice.</span></a> </span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt .75pt 10.5pt 33.0pt;">
<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 15.0pt;mso-style-unhide: no;mso-style-qformat: yes;mso-style-parent: &quot;&quot;;margin: 0in;margin-bottom: .0001pt;mso-pagination: widow-orphan;font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast;"><span style="font-family: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; color: #666666;"><a href="http://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/legal/terms-of-use.html?iid=ftr%20terms" style="mso-style-noshow: yes;mso-style-priority: 99;color: blue;text-decoration: underline;text-underline: single;"> <span style="text-decoration: none; text-underline: none;">Legal Information</span></a> | <a href="http://www.intel.com/sites/corporate/tradmarx.htm" style="mso-style-noshow: yes;mso-style-priority: 99;color: blue;text-decoration: underline;text-underline: single;"><span style="text-decoration: none; text-underline: none;">Trademarks</span></a> © Intel Corporation. All rights reserved.<br> *Other names and brands may be claimed as the property of others.<br> **Intel is not responsible for content of sites outside our intranet. </span></p>
